 ansmission line connecting Quebec's renewable energy resources to New York
  City's power grid (Zone J) under the Champlain Hudson Power Express proje
 ct. No size\, pricing\, or spread guidance has been provided at this manda
 te stage\; the deal is subject to market conditions following the investor
  call process.
